[15.360988, "o", ".\u001b[m\u001b[41m \u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32mPreviously, I was a Student Researcher at [Google Research](https://research.google/), an ML Research Intern at [Apple Health AI](https://machinelearning.apple\u001b[m\u001b[H\u001bM\\ No newline at end of file\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[31memployee at [HealthRhythms](https://www.healthrhythms.com). \u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[31ms://research.google/), an ML Research Intern at [Apple Health AI](https://machinelearning.apple.com/work-with-us) and a data scientist and the second full-time \u001b[m\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[31m-**I am looking for a full time job!** If you think we would be a good match, please reach out. Previously, I was a Student Researcher at [Google Research](http\u001b[m\u001b[H\u001bM \u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32mI am a Postdoctoral Researcher at Stanford CS.\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[31mwhere I am advised by [Tim Althoff](http://www.timalthoff.com/). I am affiliated with [UW NLP](https://twitter.com/uwnlp).\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[31m-I am a sixth year PhD student at the [Paul G. Allen School of Computer Science & Engineering](https://www.cs.washington.edu"]
